    "causal_summary": "sk-code is the single public code skill that routes a request through mode-registry.json to two workflow modes (sk-code-quality, sk-code-review) or bundles one of two read-only surface evidence packets (sk-code-ci, sk-code-skilled) over a shared surface-detection router. Each surface carries the shared implement/debug/verify workflow doctrine plus its domain knowledge. The shared router centralizes SKILLED and UNKNOWN identity and precedence so the advisor sees exactly one code identity.",
